original_raw_output:
```java
// Bad example: Vulnerable code using Statement allowing SQL injection
public class UserDAO {
    public boolean authenticate(String user, String pass) throws Exception {
        Connection conn = DriverManager.getConnection("jdbc:mysql://localhost/test");
        Statement stmt = conn.createStatement();

        // Vulnerable: Concatenating user inputs directly into query
        String query = "SELECT * FROM users WHERE username='" + user + "' AND password='" + pass + "'";
        ResultSet rs = stmt.executeQuery(query);

        return rs.next();
    }
}
```

***
```java
// Good example: Fixed code using PreparedStatement to prevent SQL injection
public class UserDAO {
    public boolean authenticate(String user, String pass) throws Exception {
        Connection conn = DriverManager.getConnection("jdbc:mysql://localhost/test");

        // Using parameterized query to sanitize inputs
        String query = "SELECT * FROM users WHERE username=? AND password=?";
        PreparedStatement stmt = conn.prepareStatement(query);
        stmt.setString(1, user);  // Safely set parameters
        stmt.setString(2, pass);

        ResultSet rs = stmt.executeQuery();
        return rs.next();
    }
}
```

